  </floating_group>
  <list ordered="false">
    <list_text>
      <location value="17"/>
      <location value="352"/>
      <location value="223"/>
      <location value="386"/>
      •	 Battery swelling is normal and does not pose any safety concerns. However, if  battery	swelling	prevents	the	battery	pack	from	fitting	in	the	camera,	contact	a	Canon	 Customer Support Help Desk.
    </list_text>
  </list>
